+- **Full attempt-log timeline + OQ-5 clipboard toast** — RC4.4. RC4.3 renders the export
+  affordance on the takeover surface (AC-mandated) wired to a plain clipboard copy of the
+  attempt log (no dead control; RC4.4 upgrades the text + verbatim toast + timeline).
+- **Notification completeness / preference matrix** — RC4.4.
+- **WoZ record-manual UI** — RC5.
